---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Airdroplyx">
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
    
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We do not collect personal information unless you subscribe to our newsletter. If you subscribe, we collect your email address.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p>We use cookies to enhance your experience and analyze traffic. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits.</p>
    
    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your email exclusively to send you updates about new cryptocurrency airdrops. We do not sell your data to third parties.</p>
    
    <h2>4. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>Our website contains links to third-party platforms (crypto airdrops). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites.</p>
    
    <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at privacy@airdroplyx.com.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
